   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# Out of Bounds Read\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "d9dc00ee",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Happens when the program or user tries to access memory before or after a buffer.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "b2de0a33",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## **Case 1**"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "6507b25c",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Happens when an array accesses an index out of bounds."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "fa237d7b",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## **Case 2**"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "6daeb5c9",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Happens when a pointer to a chunk of memory accesses an index out of bounds."
   ]
  }
 ],
